57: Theorem matrix4_guarded:forall f:Z->float32,exists m bo bi,Guarded 4 m bo bi f.
58: Proof.
59:  intro f;destruct(matrix4_inhabited f)as[m0[unused[bi H]]].
60:  unfold FiveInv2Case.Contract.Inputs in H;destruct H as[NE[W RD]].
61:  set(xs:=[(0,GuardValue 4 0);(1,GuardValue 4 1);(2,GuardValue 4 2);(3,GuardValue 4 3);(4,GuardValue 4 4);(5,GuardValue 4 5)]).
62:  destruct(guarded_extend 4 xs m0 bi f ltac:(left;reflexivity)RD)as[m[bo G]].
63:  - intros i x IN;unfold xs in IN;cbn in IN;repeat destruct IN as[IN|IN];try contradiction;inversion IN;lia.
64:  - unfold xs;repeat constructor;simpl;intuition discriminate.
65:  - intros i I;assert(i=0\/i=1\/i=2\/i=3\/i=4\/i=5)by lia;repeat destruct H as[H|H];subst i;unfold xs;repeat(first[left;reflexivity|right]).
66:  - exists m,bo,bi;exact G.
67: Qed.
68: Print Assumptions matrix4_guarded.
